Q:
x | 3.9 | 3.99 | 3.999 | 4 | 4.001 | 4.01 | 4.1
f(x) | 4.89 | 198.99 | 25,147.13 | 2 | -1,000,000 | -10,000 | -100

Which real value (if any) does h(x) appear to approach as...

1. x approaches 4 through values strictly less than 4?

2. x approaches 4 through values strictly greater than 4?

3. x approaches 4?

A:
1. x approaches 4 through values strictly less than 4: infinity -> DNE

2. x approaches 4 through values strictly greater than 4: -infinity -> DNE

3. x approaches 4: DNE

